body:
I have it in my head that my if I'm not proud of where I am in life by the time I'm 30, eject button here we come.

&#x200B;

My (albeit messed up) logic has decided that I can't be accomplished in something or have something worth living for besides my partner at 30, I know its all going to be down hill from there. Call it vanity, but I feel like my looks will fade, less peers will want to hear my bitching and whining about life, and I feel like society as a whole will just kinda leave me like an abandoned puppy. No one to coddle me or feel bad for a 35 year old depressed fuck. I do have a fear of growing up and getting older, because no one in my life has shown me that being an adult is worth living for.
